@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `il-interpretation-time`

-- ===========================================================================
-- fees-regulations.l4 — תקנות הסדרת העיסוק בעבודה במערכת קירור או מיזוג
-- אוויר (אגרות), התשפ"ה–2025, regulations 1 to 5, in three vintages.
--
--   the draft                  the SimpLEX screenshot (Figure 4 of Schwartz,
--                              Bar-Siman-Tov & Gelbard 2025). It shows the
--                              title, the preamble, reg 1, reg 2(א)-(ה) in full,
--                              and the heading of reg 3 ("עדכוני אגרות") and
--                              nothing after it. Its Hebrew below is
--                              TRANSCRIBED FROM AN IMAGE, not copied.
--   the regulations as made    קובץ התקנות 11951, 9 July 2025, p. 2116.
--   the regulations as amended קובץ התקנות 12383, 4 May 2026, p. 2062, which
--                              inserted the definition of "בחינה עיונית" in
--                              reg 1 and reg 2(א1), and rewrote reg 2(ב).
--
-- Hebrew for the two enacted vintages is copied from the Wikisource
-- consolidation (rev 3011135, unofficial) and measured against the two
-- gazette texts (NOTES.md §2 says how). The wiki's "(מתואם לשנת 2025)" notes are the wiki's,
-- not the text's, and are left out.
--
-- A vintage silent on a service answers NOTHING. A part of the draft the
-- screenshot does not show answers with a named REFUSE.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Fees Regulations`

§§ `Regulation 1 — definitions`

-- DRAFT, reg 1 (transcribed):
--   "בחינה עיונית" - בחינה להערכת הידע וההבנה העמוקה של נושאי הלימוד העיוניים
--   המופיעים בתכנית הלימודים התקנה ושירות למתקיני קירור ומיזוג אויר.
--   "בחינה מעשית" - בחינה להערכת הידע והמיומנויות המעשיות של התלמיד המופיעים
--   בתכנית הלימודים התקנה ושירות למתקיני קירור ומיזוג אויר.
-- AS MADE, reg 1 (heading "הגדרה", singular):
--   בתקנות אלה, ”בחינה מעשית“ – בחינה להערכת הידע והמיומנויות המעשיות של לומד
--   בקורס הכשרה מקצועית המופיעים בתוכנית הלימודים לעניין התקנה ושירות למיתקני
--   קירור ומיזוג אוויר.
-- AS AMENDED, KT 12383 reg 1 adds after it:
--   ”בחינה עיונית“ – בחינה להערכת הידע וההבנה העמוקה של לומד בקורס הכשרה
--   מקצועית של נושאי הלימוד העיוניים המופיעים בתוכנית הלימודים לעניין התקנה
--   ושירות למיתקני קירור ומיזוג אוויר.
@ref Fees Regulations reg 1 (draft; KT 11951 p. 2116; KT 12383 reg 1)
GIVEN e IS AN Exam, v IS A Vintage
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`regulation 1 defines` e `in` v MEANS
    CONSIDER e
    WHEN `a practical exam`   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `a theoretical exam` THEN NOT (v EQUALS `the regulations as made`)

§§ `Regulation 2 — the fees`

§§§ `Regulation 2 — the draft`

@ref Draft Fees Regulations reg 2(א), SimpLEX screenshot
GIVETH A `Regulation 2 provision`
`draft regulation 2(א)` MEANS
    `Regulation 2 provision` WITH
        `the sub-regulation`     IS "2(א)"
        `the services it prices` IS LIST `taking` `a theoretical exam`
        `the amount`             IS 273
        `the words`              IS "בעד בחינה עיונית, תשולם אגרה בסכום של 273 שקלים חדשים."

@ref Draft Fees Regulations reg 2(ב), SimpLEX screenshot
GIVETH A `Regulation 2 provision`
`draft regulation 2(ב)` MEANS
    `Regulation 2 provision` WITH
        `the sub-regulation`     IS "2(ב)"
        `the services it prices` IS LIST `taking` `a practical exam`
        `the amount`             IS 194
        `the words`              IS "בעד בחינה מעשית, תשולם אגרה בסכום של 194 שקלים חדשים."

-- "על הבחינה עיונית או המעשית": an appeal on either exam, although the fee it
-- is "added to" is the one in (א), the theoretical exam's. Fork F3.
@ref Draft Fees Regulations reg 2(ג), SimpLEX screenshot
GIVETH A `Regulation 2 provision`
`draft regulation 2(ג)` MEANS
    `Regulation 2 provision` WITH
        `the sub-regulation`     IS "2(ג)"
        `the services it prices` IS LIST `an objection to the grade of` `a theoretical exam`, `an objection to the grade of` `a practical exam`
        `the amount`             IS 40
        `the words`              IS "הוגש ערעור על הבחינה עיונית או המעשית, יתווסף לתשלום בעד האגרה כאמור בסעיף קטן (א), סכום של 40 שקלים חדשים, בעד כל ערעור."

@ref Draft Fees Regulations reg 2(ד), SimpLEX screenshot
GIVETH A `Regulation 2 provision`
`draft regulation 2(ד)` MEANS
    `Regulation 2 provision` WITH
        `the sub-regulation`     IS "2(ד)"
        `the services it prices` IS LIST `a licence, or the renewal of one, under section 5`
        `the amount`             IS 284
        `the words`              IS "בעד בקשה לקבלת רישיון או לחידושו לפי סעיף 5 לחוק, תשולם אגרה בסכום של 284 שקלים חדשים."

-- The draft says "סעיף 8". The enacted Law, and the bill as tabled for second
-- and third reading, put the temporary licence for a foreign expert at s. 9;
-- s. 8 is the validity period. The service is identified here by its
-- description, not its section number. Fork F5.
@ref Draft Fees Regulations reg 2(ה), SimpLEX screenshot
GIVETH A `Regulation 2 provision`
`draft regulation 2(ה)` MEANS
    `Regulation 2 provision` WITH
        `the sub-regulation`     IS "2(ה)"
        `the services it prices` IS LIST `a temporary licence for a foreign expert, or the renewal of one, under section 9`
        `the amount`             IS 398
        `the words`              IS "בעד בקשה לקבלת רישיון זמני למומחה זר או לחידושו לפי סעיף 8 לחוק, תשולם אגרה בסכום של 398 שקלים חדשים."

-- The draft's reg 2 is shown whole: the heading of reg 3 follows (ה).
@ref Draft Fees Regulations reg 2, SimpLEX screenshot
GIVETH A LIST OF `Regulation 2 provision`
`regulation 2 of the draft` MEANS
    LIST `draft regulation 2(א)`, `draft regulation 2(ב)`, `draft regulation 2(ג)`, `draft regulation 2(ד)`, `draft regulation 2(ה)`

§§§ `Regulation 2 — as made`

@ref Fees Regulations reg 2(א), KT 11951 p. 2116
GIVETH A `Regulation 2 provision`
`regulation 2(א) as made` MEANS
    `Regulation 2 provision` WITH
        `the sub-regulation`     IS "2(א)"
        `the services it prices` IS LIST `taking` `a practical exam`
        `the amount`             IS 194
        `the words`              IS "בעד בחינה מעשית, ישלם הנבחן אגרה בסכום של 194 שקלים חדשים."

-- "השגה על ציון הבחינה ... נוסף על ... האגרה כאמור בתקנת משנה (א)": the exam is
-- the one (א) prices, the practical exam, the only exam these Regulations as
-- made define. Fork F3.
@ref Fees Regulations reg 2(ב), KT 11951 p. 2116
GIVETH A `Regulation 2 provision`
`regulation 2(ב) as made` MEANS
    `Regulation 2 provision` WITH
        `the sub-regulation`     IS "2(ב)"
        `the services it prices` IS LIST `an objection to the grade of` `a practical exam`
        `the amount`             IS 40
        `the words`              IS "הוגשה השגה על ציון הבחינה, ישלם מגיש ההשגה, נוסף על התשלום בעד האגרה כאמור בתקנת משנה (א), סכום של 40 שקלים חדשים, בעד כל השגה."

@ref Fees Regulations reg 2(ג), KT 11951 p. 2116
GIVETH A `Regulation 2 provision`
`regulation 2(ג) as made` MEANS
    `Regulation 2 provision` WITH
        `the sub-regulation`     IS "2(ג)"
        `the services it prices` IS LIST `a licence, or the renewal of one, under section 5`
        `the amount`             IS 284
        `the words`              IS "בעד קבלת רישיון או חידושו לפי סעיף 5 לחוק, ישלם מבקש הרישיון אגרה בסכום של 284 שקלים חדשים."

@ref Fees Regulations reg 2(ד), KT 11951 p. 2116
GIVETH A `Regulation 2 provision`
`regulation 2(ד) as made` MEANS
    `Regulation 2 provision` WITH
        `the sub-regulation`     IS "2(ד)"
        `the services it prices` IS LIST `a temporary licence for a foreign expert, or the renewal of one, under section 9`
        `the amount`             IS 398
        `the words`              IS "בעד בקשה לקבלת רישיון זמני למומחה זר או לחידושו לפי סעיף 9 לחוק, ישלם מבקש הרישיון אגרה בסכום של 398 שקלים חדשים."

@ref Fees Regulations reg 2, KT 11951 p. 2116
GIVETH A LIST OF `Regulation 2 provision`
`regulation 2 as made` MEANS
    LIST `regulation 2(א) as made`, `regulation 2(ב) as made`, `regulation 2(ג) as made`, `regulation 2(ד) as made`

§§§ `Regulation 2 — as amended`

-- KT 12383 reg 2: "(1) אחרי תקנת משנה (א) יבוא - "(א1) ..."; (2) בתקנת משנה
-- (ב), אחרי "הוגשה השגה על ציון הבחינה" יבוא "העיונית" ובמקום "בתקנת משנה (א)"
-- יבוא "בתקנת משנה (א1)"." So as amended the objection fee attaches to the
-- THEORETICAL exam only, and no sub-regulation sets a fee for an objection to
-- a practical-exam grade. Fork F4. (א), (ג) and (ד) are unchanged.

@ref Fees Regulations reg 2(א1), inserted by KT 12383 reg 2(1)
GIVETH A `Regulation 2 provision`
`regulation 2(א1) as amended` MEANS
    `Regulation 2 provision` WITH
        `the sub-regulation`     IS "2(א1)"
        `the services it prices` IS LIST `taking` `a theoretical exam`
        `the amount`             IS 158
        `the words`              IS "בעד בחינה עיונית, ישלם הנבחן אגרה בסכום של 158 שקלים חדשים."

@ref Fees Regulations reg 2(ב), as amended by KT 12383 reg 2(2)
GIVETH A `Regulation 2 provision`
`regulation 2(ב) as amended` MEANS
    `Regulation 2 provision` WITH
        `the sub-regulation`     IS "2(ב)"
        `the services it prices` IS LIST `an objection to the grade of` `a theoretical exam`
        `the amount`             IS 40
        `the words`              IS "הוגשה השגה על ציון הבחינה העיונית, ישלם מגיש ההשגה, נוסף על התשלום בעד האגרה כאמור בתקנת משנה (א1), סכום של 40 שקלים חדשים, בעד כל השגה."

@ref Fees Regulations reg 2, KT 11951 p. 2116 as amended by KT 12383 reg 2
GIVETH A LIST OF `Regulation 2 provision`
`regulation 2 as amended` MEANS
    LIST `regulation 2(א) as made`, `regulation 2(א1) as amended`, `regulation 2(ב) as amended`, `regulation 2(ג) as made`, `regulation 2(ד) as made`

§§§ `Regulation 2 — the lookup`

GIVEN v IS A Vintage
GIVETH A LIST OF `Regulation 2 provision`
`regulation 2 in` v MEANS
    CONSIDER v
    WHEN `the draft`                  THEN `regulation 2 of the draft`
    WHEN `the regulations as made`    THEN `regulation 2 as made`
    WHEN `the regulations as amended` THEN `regulation 2 as amended`

-- The sub-regulation of the vintage that prices the service, if any. No
-- service is priced twice in any vintage, so the first is the only one.
GIVEN s IS A Service, v IS A Vintage
GIVETH A MAYBE `Regulation 2 provision`
`the provision of regulation 2 pricing` s `in` v MEANS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN p YIELD elem s (p's `the services it prices`)) (`regulation 2 in` v)
    WHEN EMPTY                THEN NOTHING
    WHEN p FOLLOWED BY others THEN JUST p

-- THE FEE LOOKUP. NOTHING means "this vintage sets no fee for this service":
-- silence, never a number borrowed from another vintage.
@ref Fees Regulations reg 2, in the vintage given
GIVEN s IS A Service, v IS A Vintage
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`the fee for` s `under` v MEANS
    CONSIDER `the provision of regulation 2 pricing` s `in` v
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST p  THEN JUST (p's `the amount`)

GIVEN s IS A Service, v IS A Vintage
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`the sub-regulation that sets the fee for` s `under` v MEANS
    CONSIDER `the provision of regulation 2 pricing` s `in` v
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST p  THEN JUST (p's `the sub-regulation`)

-- What the licence fee is charged on. The draft charges "בעד בקשה לקבלת
-- רישיון" (for the application); as made and as amended, "בעד קבלת רישיון" (for
-- receiving it). The amount is the same. Fork F6.
@ref Draft reg 2(ד); reg 2(ג) as made and as amended
GIVEN v IS A Vintage
GIVETH A `What the licence fee is charged on`
`what the licence fee is charged on under` v MEANS
    CONSIDER v
    WHEN `the draft` THEN `the application for the licence or its renewal`
    OTHERWISE             `the receipt of the licence or its renewal`

§§ `Regulation 3 — updating the fees`

-- AS MADE (unchanged by KT 12383):
-- (א) סכומי האגרות המפורטים בתקנה 2 יעודכנו ב־1 בינואר של כל שנה (להלן – יום
--     העדכון) לפי שיעור השינוי של המדד החדש לעומת המדד היסודי, ויעוגל לשקל
--     החדש השלם הקרוב; לעניין זה –
--     ”המדד החדש“ – המדד שפורסם בחודש נובמבר שקדם ליום העדכון;
--     ”המדד היסודי“ – המדד שפורסם בחודש נובמבר שקדם ליום העדכון הקודם, ולעניין
--     יום העדכון הראשון שלאחר יום תחילתן של תקנות אלה – המדד שפורסם בחודש
--     שלפני תחילתן של תקנות אלה;
--     ”מדד“ – מדד המחירים לצרכן שמפרסמת הלשכה המרכזית לסטטיסטיקה.
-- (ב) המנהל הכללי של משרד העבודה יפרסם בהודעה ברשומות את נוסח תקנה 2 כפי
--     שהשתנתה עקב האמור בתקנת משנה (א).
--
-- No index figure is in the sources, so every figure is an input. No notice
-- under (ב) is in the sources either: whether one was published is not known
-- here, and nothing in this encoding depends on it, because (א) does the
-- updating and (ב) only publishes the result.

@ref Draft Fees Regulations reg 3 — only the heading "עדכוני אגרות" is visible
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the draft's regulation 3 is not shown in the screenshot` MEANS
    REFUSE "the draft's regulation 3 is not shown in the screenshot"

-- "ויעוגל לשקל החדש השלם הקרוב": to the nearest whole shekel. The text does
-- not say which way a half goes; half up is taken here. Fork F9. (L4's ROUND
-- rounds half to even, which is why it is not used.)
@ref Fees Regulations reg 3(a)
GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`rounded to the nearest whole new shekel` amount MEANS FLOOR (amount PLUS 0.5)

-- One update day's arithmetic: the amount, moved by the rate of change of the
-- new index against the basic index, then rounded.
@ref Fees Regulations reg 3(a)
GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER, `the basic index` IS A NUMBER, `the new index` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`regulation 3(a) — the amount` amount `updated by the change from` `the basic index` `to` `the new index` MEANS
    `rounded to the nearest whole new shekel` (amount TIMES (`the new index` DIVIDED BY `the basic index`))

-- The update day is 1 January of each year.
@ref Fees Regulations reg 3(a), "ב־1 בינואר של כל שנה"
GIVEN `the year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATE
`the update day of` `the year` MEANS YMD `the year` 1 1

-- "ולעניין יום העדכון הראשון שלאחר יום תחילתן של תקנות אלה – המדד שפורסם בחודש
-- שלפני תחילתן": the Regulations came into force on 16 July 2025 (reg 5), so the
-- first update day after it is 1 January 2026, and its basic index is the one
-- published in June 2025.
@ref Fees Regulations reg 3(a), "המדד היסודי"
GIVEN `the year` IS A NUMBER, `the figures` IS A LIST OF `Index publication`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`the basic index for the update day of` `the year` `among` `the figures` MEANS
    IF   `the update day of` `the year` EQUALS `the first update day after the Regulations came into force`
    THEN `the index published in month` (DATE_MONTH `the month before the Regulations came into force`) `of` (DATE_YEAR `the month before the Regulations came into force`) `among` `the figures`
    ELSE `the index published in month` 11 `of` (`the year` MINUS 2) `among` `the figures`

-- "המדד החדש – המדד שפורסם בחודש נובמבר שקדם ליום העדכון": the November
-- before 1 January of the year is the November of the year before.
@ref Fees Regulations reg 3(a), "המדד החדש"
GIVEN `the year` IS A NUMBER, `the figures` IS A LIST OF `Index publication`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`the new index for the update day of` `the year` `among` `the figures` MEANS
    `the index published in month` 11 `of` (`the year` MINUS 1) `among` `the figures`

GIVEN m IS A NUMBER, y IS A NUMBER, `the figures` IS A LIST OF `Index publication`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`the index published in month` m `of` y `among` `the figures` MEANS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN i YIELD (i's `month of publication` EQUALS m) AND (i's `year of publication` EQUALS y)) `the figures`
    WHEN EMPTY                THEN NOTHING
    WHEN i FOLLOWED BY others THEN JUST (i's `the index figure`)

GIVETH A DATE
`the first update day after the Regulations came into force` MEANS
    `the update day of` (DATE_YEAR `the day the Regulations as made came into force` PLUS 1)

-- "בחודש שלפני תחילתן" names a calendar month, counted backwards; it is not a
-- period counted forward from a day, so Interpretation Law s 10 does not reach
-- it (fork F33). Only its month and year are read.
GIVETH A DATE
`the month before the Regulations came into force` MEANS
    `add months` `the day the Regulations as made came into force` (0 MINUS 1)

@ref Fees Regulations reg 3 — no index figure is in the sources
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`an index figure that regulation 3 needs was not supplied` MEANS
    REFUSE "an index figure that regulation 3 needs was not supplied"

-- The amount after every update day up to and including the update day of
-- `the year`, starting from the amount as printed and the first year it was
-- updated in. Each update moves the amount as it stood, so the rounding of
-- one year carries into the next.
@ref Fees Regulations reg 3(a)
GIVEN `the printed amount` IS A NUMBER, `the first year updated` IS A NUMBER, `the year` IS A NUMBER, `the figures` IS A LIST OF `Index publication`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the amount` `the printed amount` `first updated in` `the first year updated` `after the update day of` `the year` `using` `the figures` MEANS
    IF   `the year` LESS THAN `the first year updated`
    THEN `the printed amount`
    ELSE CONSIDER `the new index for the update day of` `the year` `among` `the figures`
         WHEN NOTHING   THEN `an index figure that regulation 3 needs was not supplied`
         WHEN JUST new THEN
             CONSIDER `the basic index for the update day of` `the year` `among` `the figures`
             WHEN NOTHING     THEN `an index figure that regulation 3 needs was not supplied`
             WHEN JUST basic THEN
                 `regulation 3(a) — the amount` (`the amount` `the printed amount` `first updated in` `the first year updated` `after the update day of` (`the year` MINUS 1) `using` `the figures`) `updated by the change from` basic `to` new

-- The year an amount was first liable to update: the first 1 January after it
-- was printed. Every amount printed by KT 11951 was printed in force from 16
-- July 2025, so it is first updated on 1 January 2026. Reg 2(א1), inserted by
-- KT 12383 in 2026, is first updated on 1 January 2027. The other amounts were
-- not reprinted by KT 12383 (only the words of 2(ב) changed), so they keep
-- their 2026 first update even under the amended text.
@ref Fees Regulations reg 3(a); KT 12383 reg 2
GIVEN s IS A Service, v IS A Vintage
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the year of the first update of the fee for` s `under` v MEANS
    IF   v EQUALS `the regulations as amended` AND s EQUALS `taking` `a theoretical exam`
    THEN DATE_YEAR `the day the amendment came into force` PLUS 1
    ELSE DATE_YEAR `the day the Regulations as made came into force` PLUS 1

-- The fee payable on a day, under the text in force that day, with reg 3's
-- updates applied. NOTHING where no Fees Regulations were yet in force, or
-- the text in force sets no fee for the service.
@ref Fees Regulations regs 2, 3(a) and 5; KT 12383
GIVEN s IS A Service, `the day` IS A DATE, `the figures` IS A LIST OF `Index publication`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`the fee payable for` s `on` `the day` `using the index figures` `the figures` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the Fees Regulations in force on` `the day`
    WHEN `no Fees Regulations were yet in force` THEN NOTHING
    WHEN `in force` v THEN
        CONSIDER `the fee for` s `under` v
        WHEN NOTHING  THEN NOTHING
        WHEN JUST fee THEN
            JUST (`the amount` fee `first updated in` (`the year of the first update of the fee for` s `under` v) `after the update day of` (DATE_YEAR `the day`) `using` `the figures`)

-- (ב) A duty with no time stated (phrasebook 5.9): no WITHIN.
@ref Fees Regulations reg 3(b)
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party Act
`regulation 3(b) — the Director-General shall publish regulation 2 as updated` MEANS
    PARTY `the Director-General of the Ministry of Labour`
    MUST  `publish in Reshumot the text of regulation 2 as updated`
    HENCE FULFILLED

§§ `Regulation 4 — payment as a condition`

-- AS MADE (unchanged by KT 12383):
--   הרשם לא ייתן רישיון שנקבעה בעדו אגרה לפי תקנות אלה ולא יחדשו, וכן האגף
--   להכשרה מקצועית לא יאפשר ביצוע של הבחינות הנדרשות או הגשת השגה על בחינות,
--   שנקבעה בעדן אגרה לפי תקנות אלה, אלא אם כן מבקש הרישיון או השירות כאמור שילם
--   את האגרה במלואה לפי תקנות אלה.
--
-- Read: for each service reg 4 names (a licence or its renewal, taking an
-- exam, filing an objection) for which these Regulations set a fee, the
-- service is withheld unless that service's fee was paid in full. A service
-- for which no fee is set is outside it. Forks F7 and F8.

@ref Fees Regulations reg 4 (as made and as amended)
GIVEN r IS A Request, v IS A Vintage
GIVETH A `What regulation 4 does to the request`
`regulation 4 as enacted — what it does to` r `under` v MEANS
    CONSIDER `the fee for` (r's `the service requested`) `under` v
    WHEN NOTHING  THEN `not reached: no fee is set for the service`
    WHEN JUST fee THEN
        IF   r's `the amount paid` AT LEAST fee
        THEN `not withheld: the fee set for the service was paid in full`
        ELSE `withheld: the fee set for the service was not paid in full`

-- THE DRAFT'S REGULATION 4 IS NOT SHOWN. The screenshot carries only the
-- SimpLEX panel's one-line gloss of it, in the worked example: "תקנה 4: אוסרת
-- רישום ללא תשלום" (regulation 4: prohibits registration without payment),
-- and the test table's citation of it for row 8. This encodes that gloss and
-- no more (fork F2):
--   * a service whose fee under draft reg 2 was paid in full is not withheld:
--     a payment condition, whatever its words, is met by full payment;
--   * registration for an exam with nothing paid is withheld (the gloss);
--   * anything else — part-payment, an unpaid objection or licence, a service
--     draft reg 2 does not price — the gloss does not reach, and the model
--     declines.
@ref Draft Fees Regulations reg 4 — text not shown; the SimpLEX panel's gloss only
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the draft's regulation 4 is not shown, and its gloss reaches only registration for an exam with nothing paid` MEANS
    REFUSE "the draft's regulation 4 is not shown, and its gloss reaches only registration for an exam with nothing paid"

@ref Draft Fees Regulations reg 4, by the SimpLEX gloss "אוסרת רישום ללא תשלום"
GIVEN r IS A Request
GIVETH A `What regulation 4 does to the request`
`the draft's regulation 4, as glossed — what it does to` r MEANS
    CONSIDER `the fee for` (r's `the service requested`) `under` `the draft`
    WHEN NOTHING  THEN `the draft's regulation 4 is not shown, and its gloss reaches only registration for an exam with nothing paid`
    WHEN JUST fee THEN
        BRANCH
            IF   r's `the amount paid` AT LEAST fee
            THEN `not withheld: the fee set for the service was paid in full`
            IF   `a request to take an exam` r AND r's `the amount paid` EQUALS 0
            THEN `withheld: the fee set for the service was not paid in full`
            OTHERWISE `the draft's regulation 4 is not shown, and its gloss reaches only registration for an exam with nothing paid`

GIVEN r IS A Request
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`a request to take an exam` r MEANS
    CONSIDER r's `the service requested`
    WHEN `taking` e THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

@ref Fees Regulations reg 4, in the vintage given
GIVEN r IS A Request, v IS A Vintage
GIVETH A `What regulation 4 does to the request`
`regulation 4 — what it does to` r `under` v MEANS
    CONSIDER v
    WHEN `the draft` THEN `the draft's regulation 4, as glossed — what it does to` r
    OTHERWISE             `regulation 4 as enacted — what it does to` r `under` v

-- Who reg 4 binds: "הרשם" for a licence, "האגף להכשרה מקצועית" for exams and
-- objections.
@ref Fees Regulations reg 4
GIVEN s IS A Service
GIVETH A Party
`the office regulation 4 binds for` s MEANS
    CONSIDER s
    WHEN `taking` e                       THEN `the Division for vocational training`
    WHEN `an objection to the grade of` e THEN `the Division for vocational training`
    OTHERWISE                                  `the Registrar`

GIVEN s IS A Service
GIVETH AN Act
`the act regulation 4 withholds for` s MEANS
    CONSIDER s
    WHEN `taking` e                       THEN `allow the exam to be taken`
    WHEN `an objection to the grade of` e THEN `allow the objection to be filed`
    OTHERWISE                                  `give or renew the licence`

-- The prohibition itself: undeadlined, so it holds until the fee is paid.
@ref Fees Regulations reg 4
GIVEN r IS A Request, v IS A Vintage
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party Act
`regulation 4 — the prohibition on` r `under` v MEANS
    CONSIDER `regulation 4 — what it does to` r `under` v
    WHEN `withheld: the fee set for the service was not paid in full` THEN
        PARTY `the office regulation 4 binds for` (r's `the service requested`)
        SHANT `the act regulation 4 withholds for` (r's `the service requested`)
        HENCE FULFILLED
        LEST  BREACH BY `the office regulation 4 binds for` (r's `the service requested`)
              BECAUSE "reg 4: a service for which a fee is set was given before the fee was paid in full"
    OTHERWISE FULFILLED

§§ `Regulation 5 — commencement`

-- AS MADE: "תחילתן של תקנות אלה 7 ימים מיום פרסומן." KT 11951 is dated 9 July
-- 2025.
--
-- Counting (Interpretation Law s 10(a), from il-interpretation-time.l4): a
-- period of days "from" a day does not count that day, so the seven days are
-- 10 to 16 July and the last of them is 16 July 2025. The Regulations come into
-- force on that last day (fork F32; Wikisource's note on reg 5 gives the same
-- day, "ותחילתן ביום 16.7.2025"). s 10(c) is not applied to a commencement
-- (fork F31): 16 July 2025 was a Wednesday, so no calendar of weekly rest would
-- move it anyway.
--
-- Interpretation Ordinance s 17: regulations of legislative effect come into
-- force on the day of publication "if there is no other provision"; reg 5 is
-- that other provision, and supplies the day.
@ref Fees Regulations reg 5; KT 11951, 9.7.2025
GIVETH A DATE
`the day the Regulations as made were published` MEANS YMD 2025 7 9

@ref Fees Regulations reg 5; Interpretation Law s 10(a)
GIVETH A DATE
`regulation 5 — the last of the seven days from publication` MEANS
    `s 10(a) — the last day of a period of` 7 `days from` `the day the Regulations as made were published`

@ref Fees Regulations reg 5; Interpretation Ordinance s 17
GIVETH A DATE
`the day the Regulations as made came into force` MEANS
    `Ordinance s 17 — the day regulations of legislative effect come into force, published on` `the day the Regulations as made were published` `unless another provision fixes the day:` (JUST `regulation 5 — the last of the seven days from publication`)

-- KT 12383 has NO commencement provision. It is dated 4 May 2026 (signed 28
-- April 2026). Interpretation Ordinance s 17 (in il-interpretation-time.l4)
-- supplies the rule: regulations of legislative effect come into force on the
-- day of their publication if no other provision fixes the day. So KT 12383
-- came into force on 4 May 2026. Fork F10, which until 2026-10-13 recorded this
-- day as ASSUMED because the rule was not among the sources then.
@ref KT 12383, 4.5.2026 — no commencement clause; Interpretation Ordinance s 17
GIVETH A DATE
`the day KT 12383 was published` MEANS YMD 2026 5 4

@ref KT 12383; Interpretation Ordinance s 17
GIVETH A DATE
`the day the amendment came into force` MEANS
    `Ordinance s 17 — the day regulations of legislative effect come into force, published on` `the day KT 12383 was published` `unless another provision fixes the day:` NOTHING

@ref Draft Fees Regulations — reg 5 not shown
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the draft's commencement provision is not shown in the screenshot` MEANS
    REFUSE "the draft's commencement provision is not shown in the screenshot"

-- Which text was in force on a day. The draft never was. Before 16 July 2025
-- there were no Fees Regulations: the law's own answer, not a gap.
@ref Fees Regulations reg 5; KT 12383; Interpretation Ordinance s 17
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Fees Regulations in force`
`the Fees Regulations in force on` `the day` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF   `the day` LESS THAN `the day the Regulations as made came into force`
        THEN `no Fees Regulations were yet in force`
        IF   `the day` LESS THAN `the day the amendment came into force`
        THEN `in force` `the regulations as made`
        OTHERWISE `in force` `the regulations as amended`
